OL,3,GNEWSAShopping centre reopens after
OL,4,Aemergency closure
OL,5,
OL,6,FA shopping, cinema and leisure
OL,7,Factivities centre that was forced to
OL,8,Fclose for nearly two weeks has
OL,9,Freopened.
OL,11,FThe Buttermarket in Ipswich shut its
OL,12,Fdoors on 21 September after the
OL,13,F"failure" of a tempered glass panel in
OL,14,Fthe north mall.
OL,16,FIn a post on social media on Friday,
OL,17,Fthe business said it was reopening at
OL,18,F15:00 BST. The centre includes
OL,19,Frestaurants, shops, an Omniplex cinema
OL,20,Fand a bowling alley/games arcade.
OL,23,APub: 02-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
